  accTitle: Data model
  accDescr: A referral has barriers, a transport record, an arrival, a clinical outcome and a follow-up plan with tasks, and records timeline entries, audit events, contact logs and redirects. A facility receives referrals and a navigator is the named contact.
  REFERRAL ||--o{ BARRIER : has
  REFERRAL ||--o| TRANSPORT : has
  REFERRAL ||--o| ARRIVAL : has
  REFERRAL ||--o| CLINICAL_OUTCOME : has
  REFERRAL ||--o| FOLLOW_UP_PLAN : starts
  FOLLOW_UP_PLAN ||--|{ FOLLOW_UP_TASK : contains
  REFERRAL ||--o{ TIMELINE_ENTRY : records
  REFERRAL ||--o{ AUDIT_EVENT : records
  REFERRAL ||--o{ CONTACT_LOG : records
  REFERRAL ||--o{ REDIRECT : records
  FACILITY ||--o{ REFERRAL : receives
  NAVIGATOR ||--o{ REFERRAL : "named contact"
